# POSCAR -> Bilbao-style CIF (crystod-group --poscar2cif); testsuite section 22
# Writes <POSCAR>.cif in the Bilbao Crystallographic Server layout
# (spglib-standardized ITA conventional cell; full operator list; one site per Wyckoff orbit).
#
# Run every command inside this directory. The inputs are local copies, so
# every output is written here and nothing outside this directory changes:
#   221_PPOSCAR_ScF3, 225_PPOSCAR_NaCl, 14_PPOSCAR_ZrO2   copies of the test_POSCARs files of the same name
#   POSCAR_CaTiO3_Pnma                                   copy of 62_PPOSCAR_CaTiO3 in test_POSCARs
#   221_PPOSCAR_SrTiO3.cif                               the --poscar2cif CIF of 221_PPOSCAR_SrTiO3 in test_POSCARs
#   POSCAR_La3Ni2O7_Cmcm.cif                             copy of the file of the same name in 23_symmetry_mode

$ crystod-group --poscar2cif -c 221_PPOSCAR_ScF3

